# Workflow list pages

Inbox lists for status workflows. Mirror **`src/features/time-off/`** (`/team/time-off`). Keep the list-page table shell; do not treat review as soft-delete CRUD.

## Rules

- Same shell: `useXListPage` + `XListPage` + `TablePageViewport` / `DynamicTable` / `TableSkeleton`
- Split surfaces: create/cancel on requester (e.g. profile); approve/reject on the inbox
- Gate row actions with **status + server-computed** flag (e.g. `canReview`) — not only `Actions.*.write`
- Thin `*ReviewForm` modals; status transitions (`PENDING` → …); side effects stay in server actions
- Toolbar often has no Create; empty copy may point requesters elsewhere
- `logActivity` + `organizationId` on transitions

See `.docs/components/workflow-list-pages.md`. Plain CRUD: `.docs/components/list-pages.md`.
